    "title": "E Bike Cost in Australia: Price Ranges by Bike Type",
    "excerpt": "E bike cost in Australia runs from $1,599 for a kids bike to $4,990 for a dual-motor fat tyre, with RTR commuters in between. See real prices by bike type.",
