    "slug": "e-bike-dirt-bike-electric-off-road-comparison",
    "title": "E Bike Dirt Bike: Pedal E-Bike vs Electric Dirt Bike",
    "excerpt": "E bike dirt bike searches mix two very different machines. Learn how pedal e-bikes and electric dirt bikes differ on power, weight, price and where you can ride.",
    "category": "Comparisons",
    "date": "2026-10-07",
    "readTime": "8 min read",
