    "slug": "electric-motorbikes-australia-buying-steps",
    "title": "Electric Motorbikes Australia: 7 Steps Before You Buy",
    "excerpt": "Shopping for electric motorbikes Australia wide? Work through seven checks on use, licence, battery, cost, fit, delivery and payment before you pay.",
