    "slug": "electric-motorcycle-price-australia-what-you-get",
    "title": "Electric Motorcycle Price Australia: What $5K to $15K+ Buys",
    "excerpt": "The electric motorcycle Australia price range runs from about $5,000 to well past $15,000. See what each tier adds in power, battery and use, with real stocked models.",
    "category": "Buyers Guide",
    "date": "2026-10-07",
